      "extract": "msp ALGEBRA AND NUMBER THEORY 14:7 (2020) https://doi.org/10.2140/ant.2020.14.1791 Elliptic curves over totally real cubic ﬁelds are modular Maarten Derickx, Filip Najman and Samir Siksek We prove that all elliptic curves deﬁned over totally real cubic ﬁelds are modular. This builds on previous work of Freitas, Le Hung and Siksek, who proved modularity of elliptic curves over real quadratic ﬁelds, as well as recent",
